    "AK-50 Unique.Explanation": "AK-50 >Real AK<\nThis unique variant adopts most of its statistics from the AK-74",
    "AK-50 Unique.ShortName": ">Real AK<",
    "Mosin Sniper Unique.Name": ">Anti-Unheard Rifle<",
    "Mosin Sniper Unique.Description": "The 'gun of shoulder destruction' - now in an even more >Unheard< edition",
    "Mosin Sniper Unique.Explanation": "Mosin Sniper >The Unheard Edition & AMR & Hypersonic & No-Bolt<\nThis unique variant is chambered in 12.7x108mm, uses The Unheard Edition magazines, has massive visible recoil, functions as a DMR, and features extreme muzzle velocity",
