    "PKM Unique.Name": ">Heavy P2W Gun<",
    "PKM Unique.Description": "Someone really wanted to have a mobile 12.7x108 mm caliber light machine gun in their hands. But the thing is, we can't allow just anyone to wield this kind of power, so we made this weapon as a good middle ground",
    "PKM Unique.Explanation": "PKM >Heavy Pay2Win Gun<\nThis unique variant blends the best traits of the Heavy Machine Gun Variant - reduced recoil and increased fire rate - with the .50 BMG caliber from the Pay2Win Variant. Not to mention, we are bundling a 100-round .50 BMG magazine with it!",
