    "AK-103 Unique.ShortName": ">Russian Market<",
    "MP5K-N Unique.Name": ">Handy AR<",
    "MP5K-N Unique.Description": "A perfectly disguised M4A1, now with authentic German aesthetics!",
    "MP5K-N Unique.Explanation": "MP5K-N >Handy Assault Rifle<\nThis unique variant is chambered in 5.56x45mm and has massively increased ergonomics",
