    "Blicky Unique.Name": ">Neverending<",
    "Blicky Unique.Description": "\"When you don't have damage, you need a lot of ammo\"\n~Sun Tzu - The Art of War",
    "Blicky Unique.Explanation": "Blicky >Neverending<\nThis unique variant has enormous magazines, fires bullets at four times their normal muzzle velocity, has a fire rate of 9000 RPM and absolutely no recoil. Clearly this makes it a perfectly practical combat weapon. The tactical advantages are obvious. The enemy will surrender immediately. NATO probably banned it. Actually... maybe they didn't. Look, it's a toy gun, alright? Just have fun",
    "Blicky Unique.ShortName": ">Neverending<",
