    "APB_Unique_RingScopeMount.Description": "A Nightforce X-Treme Duty Ultralite one-piece Magmount for the {APB Unique.Name} Variant Weapon. It allows the {APB_Unique_Scope.Name} to be attached to {APB Unique.Name}. {Trader.Nickname} didn't want to create this attachment, but he had to",
