    "Blicky_Unique_Mag.Name": "{Blicky Unique.Name} 20x1 20k-round magazine",
    "Blicky_Unique_Mag.Description": "A 20k-round 20x1mm special, magical, unbelievable and spacious disk magazine for the {Blicky Unique.Name} Variant Weapon. We strongly recommend loading it with coins. A huge number of coins. Dreamed up by {Trader.Nickname}",
