    "Endless_Mag_Assault.Description": "A 500-round 7.62x51mm NATO/7.62x39mm/5.56x45mm ammo box for {Endless.Name} Variant Type Weapons in the assault rifle, marksman rifle and assault carbine categories. Manufactured from a shipping container by {Trader.Nickname}",
    "Endless_Mag_Assault.ShortName": "{Endless.Name} multi-caliber 500-round ammo box",
