    "Endless_Mag_SMG.Description": "An 800-round .45 ACP/9x19mm/4.6x30mm HK/5.7x28mm FN ammo box for {Endless.Name} Variant Type Weapons in the SMG category. Manufactured from a shipping container by {Trader.Nickname}",
