    "Trader.Description": "An Italian mafioso who started out smuggling unusual weapons across borders. What began as business eventually became an obsession\n\nOver the years, he collected, commissioned, modified, and meticulously categorized strange Weapon Variants from all around the world. Nobody knows how large his personal collection really is, but one thing is certain: whatever he sells you is just a spare\n\nAnd, naturally, he refuses normal money. His own strange currency is the only thing he considers worth trading for\n\nRumor has it that his shop can be found inside a shipping container somewhere in Tarkov. Never the same container, never in the same place\n\nStrangely enough, whenever you actually need to buy something, you always seem to find it"
